{"rule":"lemma-pool/v1","groups":{"desmaiar":{"host":"8f3199c1","siblings":["115aed9f"]}},"rows":{"115aed9f":{"word":"desmaiar","rank":7941,"meanings":[{"headword":"desmaiar","pos":"verb","source_reference":"kaikki:en-desmaiar-pt-verb-SUYB9ZHx","translation":"to faint (to lose consciousness)"}]}},"examples":{"115aed9f":{"m":[[{"t":"Porque tenho a tensão baixa e vou desmaiar.","e":"'Cause I got low blood pressure and I'm gonna pass out.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.817026,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"f72237e5d8d76c0815f0afa70c33fa41","i":"02c9668041bcbb11ed1325a5bfa8befe","r":"4645280:6662836:363:2835965","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["4645280","6662836","363"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"O meu coração está a bater tão rápido, acho que vou desmaiar.","e":"My heart is beating so fast right now I think I might swoon.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.888485,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"d86805d26410ad7eb955d5c0e05aa159","i":"45022ec0dac19b1df9808bd7ac582c09","r":"2822578:6360472:1088:230529","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["2822578","6360472","1088"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Eles precisam de comida, e depressa, antes que comecem a desmaiar.","e":"They need food. And soon before they start to fall over.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.805874,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"b8564c8ff8ec1e16f3484612da50646d","i":"5975d55c96ae7832d13638f4ab63cc08","r":"2726552:6938780:156:2366319","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["2726552","6938780","156"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Não quero ir para ali e desmaiar outra vez.","e":"I don't want to go up there and keel over again.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.879694,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"498ed5f8bd500d981de3ff2093ff30b9","i":"6f4a7c97af90f78b6c6a312d99953891","r":"4296024:6722794:181:1272394","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["4296024","6722794","181"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Não és a primeira dama que faço desmaiar.","e":"You aren't the first lady I've made swoon.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.915592,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"41159e0770461940b32d8fbc0ac4f6c7","i":"8dbcae64b2c1179470c03b8ba4e11f5d","r":"5223062:6478089:751:3446768","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5223062","6478089","751"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Mas antes de desmaiar, eu vi alguém... maior.","e":"But before I blacked out, I saw someone... bigger.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.893724,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"b0f7b245428c1391402feda3b8eb1071","i":"a6f134cdc65b20fef8d84e7e34b5380c","r":"5931804:6791079:71:4110272","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5931804","6791079","71"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Ela disse que era, sabe, antes de desmaiar.","e":"She said she was, you know, before she passed out.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.863925,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"6742bb83238de756c92baf88c34325ff","i":"cd25e909bd7e5ba15a4551ed04802cc0","r":"5895712:6762363:148:4090271","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5895712","6762363","148"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Não me vou embora, mas ainda posso desmaiar.","e":"I'm not leaving, but I still might faint.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.910977,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"3edbc003789a289bae9e310fc7cdd1ef","i":"e484782d270a2a85dd4d37790bfac18b","r":"4857484:6546678:227:3025348","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["4857484","6546678","227"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Estava tão quente no estádio que eu pensei que fosse desmaiar.","e":"It was so hot in the stadium that I thought I was going to pass out.","s":"tatoeba","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.834327,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"a2e7639124dd8f5a23d47f59eed3ce40","i":"e5a4e6b5f48ed45db1082d7bbb269fb3","r":"2573572:51969","c":"alexmarcelo","su":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/2573572","ul":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/2573572","b":"Tatoeba sentence #2573572 by alexmarcelo; English translation #51969 by CK","o":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/2573572","tu":1,"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Não é a doença que me faz desmaiar.","e":"It's not the illness that makes me faint.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.913677,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"6337e97c0a03e012f5e064b2720cb6ff","i":"e94fbfe1beb8108db2202fef3165f617","r":"4283390:6463959:519:1248174","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["4283390","6463959","519"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Essa foi a última coisa que ele disse antes de desmaiar.","e":"That was the last thing he said before he passed out.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.841071,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"cb9468a40759859dacd1e94d493e4cad","i":"fafba7e66222dbc4ad1c633460161dde","r":"4548724:6657836:372:1681910","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["4548724","6657836","372"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Se acharem que conseguem beber uma sem desmaiar.","e":"If you think you can have one without passing out.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.730725,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"cf6dc54efd65c9abeb532efebfed8668","i":"393948cb604636ae48914d0283fb3f61","r":"5514638:6966195:133:3758347","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5514638","6966195","133"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"O seu está protegido e cresceu depressa para desmaiar por causa do sangue.","e":"He's sheltered and he's too big to be freaking out at the sight of blood.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.634915,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"ec9d1be298518928e0fca2ed51210565","i":"2c525f113db597aed917fedc19684c6a","r":"4234598:6573910:267:1132526","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["4234598","6573910","267"],"w":["leaf",0]}]]}}}